user_customdata2.description:
A JSON array of image filenames and prompts that match the placeholder filenames in the interactive fiction story. The json array should be structured like this:
[{"filename": "a-placeholder-filename", "prompt": "image-description"}]
e.g 
[
  {
    "filename": "01.png",
    "prompt": "Black and white movie still. A dark, snowy street in 1980s Moscow. A lone man in a heavy coat stands by a payphone under a dim streetlamp. Grainy texture, high contrast shadows."
  },
  {
    "filename": "02.png",
    "prompt": "Black and white movie still. A grim discovery in Gorky Park. Three shapes lie in the deep snow near a frozen pond. The atmosphere is cold and silent. Low angle shot, dramatic lighting."
  }
]
